    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WHISHLIST NOW!!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/f29a07b9c20caf66ed7a88e27bb93767.poster.avif?t=1739353634\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/f29a07b9c20caf66ed7a88e27bb93767.webm?t=1739353634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/1a7414ac09e008c2d4e0b7c989609802.avif?t=1739353634\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barraka is a fascinating claymation adventure game that will arouse your curiosity and take you into a world full of puzzles and surprises. Get ready to join our brave heroine in an exciting exploration of the spooky fair of a small town, where every corner holds secrets to be discovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Ainhoa on her thrilling adventure through a mysterious village fair set in the 90's! This amazing journey will be filled with exploration, puzzles and surprises, from her mother's warm churro stand to the epic showdown with the wicked witch and her minions. As you collect coins and progress through this magical and fascinating amusement park, you will encounter new levels, challenges, huts and mini-games. Barraka's incredible world has been meticulously created by hand with plasticine and animated using the stop motion technique. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/8ba33426a6c2a569ed8488c381ac2098.poster.avif?t=1739353634\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/8ba33426a6c2a569ed8488c381ac2098.webm?t=1739353634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/8ba33426a6c2a569ed8488c381ac2098.mp4?t=1739353634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to meet and help unforgettable characters while facing colorful enemies that will make you laugh your head off. Visit the haunted house, explore a mysterious mini-circus, ride the bumper cars or enjoy a merry-go-round that transforms into a horizontal scrolling space shooter with a boss ending. Every corner of the Barraka fair has surprises that are as fun as they are challenging! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't miss this opportunity and join us in this incredible plasticine adventure! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautifully crafted graphics</strong> that combines real images, stop motion and traditional animation to recreate an amazing <strong>plasticine</strong> universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A magical world where <strong>lovable characters and disturbing enemies</strong> coexist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>unforgettable attractions</strong>: the bumper cars, the merry-go-round, the haunted house and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun with <strong>classic mini-games</strong> that will test your skills such as mole smashing or target shooting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new equipment and upgrade it to help Ainhoa progress in her adventure and discover all the secrets of the <strong>mysterious amusement park</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get caught by its ambient <strong>soundtrack</strong> and its hilarious sound effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/d1fb4d865bcc76e5a4b533dae2c2bfc7.poster.avif?t=1739353634\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/d1fb4d865bcc76e5a4b533dae2c2bfc7.webm?t=1739353634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/d1fb4d865bcc76e5a4b533dae2c2bfc7.mp4?t=1739353634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/1a7414ac09e008c2d4e0b7c989609802.avif?t=1739353634\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barraka is a fascinating claymation adventure game that will arouse your curiosity and take you into a world full of puzzles and surprises. Get ready to join our brave heroine in an exciting exploration of the spooky fair of a small town, where every corner holds secrets to be discovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Ainhoa on her thrilling adventure through a mysterious village fair set in the 90's! This amazing journey will be filled with exploration, puzzles and surprises, from her mother's warm churro stand to the epic showdown with the wicked witch and her minions. As you collect coins and progress through this magical and fascinating amusement park, you will encounter new levels, challenges, huts and mini-games. Barraka's incredible world has been meticulously created by hand with plasticine and animated using the stop motion technique. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/8ba33426a6c2a569ed8488c381ac2098.poster.avif?t=1739353634\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/8ba33426a6c2a569ed8488c381ac2098.webm?t=1739353634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/8ba33426a6c2a569ed8488c381ac2098.mp4?t=1739353634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to meet and help unforgettable characters while facing colorful enemies that will make you laugh your head off. Visit the haunted house, explore a mysterious mini-circus, ride the bumper cars or enjoy a merry-go-round that transforms into a horizontal scrolling space shooter with a boss ending. Every corner of the Barraka fair has surprises that are as fun as they are challenging! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't miss this opportunity and join us in this incredible plasticine adventure! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautifully crafted graphics</strong> that combines real images, stop motion and traditional animation to recreate an amazing <strong>plasticine</strong> universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A magical world where <strong>lovable characters and disturbing enemies</strong> coexist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>unforgettable attractions</strong>: the bumper cars, the merry-go-round, the haunted house and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun with <strong>classic mini-games</strong> that will test your skills such as mole smashing or target shooting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new equipment and upgrade it to help Ainhoa progress in her adventure and discover all the secrets of the <strong>mysterious amusement park</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get caught by its ambient <strong>soundtrack</strong> and its hilarious sound effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/d1fb4d865bcc76e5a4b533dae2c2bfc7.poster.avif?t=1739353634\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/d1fb4d865bcc76e5a4b533dae2c2bfc7.webm?t=1739353634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041440/extras/d1fb4d865bcc76e5a4b533dae2c2bfc7.mp4?t=1739353634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
